<title>CANADA: Canada C$1.5 billion 49-day yields avg 2.910 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$1.5 billion 49-day yields avg 2.910 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said its C$1.5 billion auction of 49-day T-bills due May 1 produced the following results:</p>
<p>				 YIELD   PRICE</p>
<p>			  AVG   2.910   N/A     PCT AT</p>
<p>			  LO    2.895   N/A     HI YLD</p>
<p>			  HI    2.940   N/A     55.000</p>
<p>The bills will be issued on March 13. The Bank of Canada bought none.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
